{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMEVxdWFsaXplciUyMCUyODIwMTQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Equalizer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9u4yW7yPA0BQ2pv9XwiNzItwvp8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9vAoubhoZE8aSkUZoSfxs3UWZhO.jpg","description":"McCall believes he has put his mysterious past behind him and dedicated himself to beginning a new, quiet life. But when he meets Teri, a young girl under the control of ultra-violent Russian gangsters, he can’t stand idly by – he has to help her. Armed with hidden skills that allow him to serve vengeance against anyone who would brutalize the helpless, McCall comes out of his self-imposed retirement and finds his desire for justice reawakened. If someone has a problem, if the odds are stacked against them, if they have nowhere else to turn, McCall will help. He is The Equalizer.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Thriller","Action","Crime","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.3","runtime":"132 min","cast":["Denzel Washington","Marton Csokas","Chloë Grace Moretz","David Harbour","Haley Bennett","Bill Pullman","Melissa Leo","David Meunier"],"director":["Antoine Fuqua"],"released":"2014-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"What do you see when you look at me?","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Denzel Washington","character":"Robert McCall","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jj2Gcobpopokal0YstuCQW0ldJ4.jpg"},{"name":"Marton Csokas","character":"Teddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gmeUY7FR0bFLdu7Ma5kvpH3Gt6B.jpg"},{"name":"Chloë Grace Moretz","character":"Teri","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yq4rYmaTRC5degaOYmJQFpaiho1.jpg"},{"name":"David Harbour","character":"Masters","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qMFtMWlYVtFVyBoBhX5IoA5sN5a.jpg"},{"name":"Haley Bennett","character":"Mandy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gNJN5I254ilKEH4cKT90ydjYeyJ.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Pullman","character":"Brian Plummer","photo":"https